{%- comment -%}
  AETHER inline icon set — Design Pack icon strategy.
  PHANTOM has no icon library (verified Task 3 Step 0: zero Font Awesome /
  iconfont references anywhere in the theme; only snippets/font-face.liquid
  exists). The frozen frontend used `i.fas` / `i.fab` glyphs, which render
  empty without FA — this snippet replaces them with inline SVGs
  (currentColor, zero network requests).
  Usage: {% render 'aether-icon', name: 'search', class: 'aether-icon' %}
  `name` accepts the frozen fa-* values ('fa-truck') and short names
  ('truck'). FA5-free solid paths reproduced for the header glyphs; bolt,
  truck, undo and brand glyphs are minimal stroke equivalents (D-list:
  FA path fidelity — monochrome 0.6-1.1rem glyphs, no visual drift).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign icon_name = name | remove: 'fa-' | strip | downcase
  assign icon_class = class | default: ''
-%}
